Convert manual regression test cases into automated tests and improve automation coverage;
Perform API testing and troubleshoot test failures;
Review automation code and promote reusable, maintainable solutions;
Integrate automated tests into CI/CD pipelines;
Collaborate with development and QA teams within an Agile environment

